            "video_url": "",
            "date": "7/20/2026",
            "star": 5,
            "title": "",
            "content": "I was a little nervous ordering fine jewelry online, but this ring completely exceeded my expectations. The diamond is incredibly bright and looks even more beautiful in person.",
            "name": "Emily R."
