            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ugc-photo-1.webp",
            "video_url": "",
            "date": "7/25/2026",
            "star": 5,
            "title": "",
            "content": "Absolutely love this necklace. It’s delicate without feeling too fragile, and the diamond catches the light beautifully. I’ve been wearing it almost every day since it arrived.",
            "name": "Hannah Mitchell"
          }
        },
        "item_QNKPVW": {
