                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Are lab grown diamonds real diamonds?",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_nNbWCq": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>Yes. Lab grown diamonds are 100% real diamonds. They are chemically, physically, and optically identical to earth-mined diamonds. The only difference is their origin. Instead of forming deep within the earth over billions of years, they are created in controlled environments using advanced technology that mirrors natural diamond formation.</p>",
                            "width": "100%",
