                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_RDjmAy": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Are lab grown diamonds as hard and durable as mined diamonds?",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_Rk99hA": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>Yes. Diamonds are the hardest material on earth, and lab grown diamonds share that exact property. They rank 10/10 on the Mohs hardness scale. This makes them extremely resistant to scratches and perfectly suited for everyday wear, including engagement rings.</p>",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "rte",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "1rem",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
                            "case": "none",
                            "wrap": "pretty",
                            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                            "background": false,
                            "background_color": "#00000026",
                            "corner_radius": 0,
                            "padding-block-start": 0,
                            "padding-block-end": 0,
                            "padding-inline-start": 0,
                            "padding-inline-end": 0
                          },
                          "blocks": {}
                        }
                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_Rk99hA"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_4X8kzq": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "Do lab grown diamonds come with certifications?",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_HVHezi": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>Yes. At Ecglosty, our diamonds are professionally graded and certified by leading gemological laboratories such as IGI or GIA. These certificates verify the diamond’s 4Cs: Cut, Color, Clarity, and Carat weight, ensuring you know exactly what you are purchasing.</p>",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "none",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "rte",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "1rem",
